# ApexOS Cloudflare Pages Deployment Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "User Access"
        U[User Browser]
        CDN[Cloudflare CDN]
    end

    subgraph "Cloudflare Pages"
        P1[Production<br/>apex-os.pages.dev]
        P2[Preview<br/>branch-name.pages.dev]
    end

    subgraph "OpenNext Deployment"
        ON[.open-next/]
        WR[worker-wrapper.js]
        RTS[_routes]
        STAT[Static Assets]
        FN[Functions]
    end

    subgraph "Cloudflare Workers Bindings"
        KV[KV Namespace<br/>apex-os-cache]
        D1D1[(D1 Database<br/>apex-os-db)]
        R2[R2 Bucket<br/>apex-os-uploads]
    end

    subgraph "External Services"
        RES[Resend<br/>Email API]
        STELLAR[Stellar<br/>USDC Payouts]
        EX[Exchanges<br/>Binance/Bybit]
        AUTH[Better Auth<br/>D1 Adapter]
    end

    U --> CDN
    CDN --> P1
    CDN --> P2

    P1 --> ON
    P2 --> ON

    ON --> WR
    ON --> RTS
    ON --> STAT
    ON --> FN

    WR --> KV
    WR --> D1D1
    WR --> R2

    FN -->|API Routes| WR
    WR -->|DB Queries| D1D1
    WR -->|Cache| KV
    WR -->|Storage| R2
    WR -->|Emails| RES
    WR -->|Payouts| STELLAR
    WR -->|Webhooks| EX
    WR -->|Auth| AUTH

    style P1 fill:#4ade80
    style D1D1 fill:#60a5fa
    style KV fill:#fbbf24
    style R2 fill:#a855f7
```

## Deployment Flow

```mermaid
graph LR
    Dev[Developer] -->|1. git push| GH[GitHub Repository]

    GH -->|2. Webhook| CP[Cloudflare Pages]

    subgraph CP
        B1[Build: pnpm build] --> B2[OpenNext: .open-next/]
        B2 --> B3[Deploy]
    end

    CP -->|3. Deploy| PROD[Production<br/>apex-os.pages.dev]

    subgraph Env[Production Environment]
        EV[Env Vars] -->|SECRETS| PROD
        D1[(D1)] -->|Database| PROD
        KV[KV] -->|Cache| PROD
        R2[R2] -->|Storage| PROD
    end

    PROD -->|4. Live| Users[End Users]

    Dev -->|Manual: wrangler| Direct[Direct Deploy]
    Direct --> PROD

    style PROD fill:#22c55e
    style Dev fill:#3b82f6
```

## Build Pipeline

```mermaid
graph TB
    Start[Source Code] -->|pnpm install| Deps[Dependencies]

    Deps -->|pnpm build| Build[Next.js Build]

    Build -->|OpenNext| ON1[Generate .open-next/]
    ON1 --> ON2[worker-wrapper.js]
    ON1 --> ON3[_routes]
    ON1 --> ON4[static/]
    ON1 --> ON5[functions/]

    ON2 -->|Upload| CF[Cloudflare Pages]
    ON3 -->|Upload| CF
    ON4 -->|Upload| CF
    ON5 -->|Upload| CF

    CF -->|Bind| D1[D1 Database]
    CF -->|Bind| KV[KV Namespace]
    CF -->|Bind| R2[R2 Bucket]

    subgraph "Runtime"
        CF -->|Handle| Req[Requests]
        Req -->|API| Worker[Worker]
        Req -->|Static| Static[Static Files]
        Worker -->|DB| D1
        Worker -->|Cache| KV
        Worker -->|Storage| R2
    end

    style CF fill:#f58231
    style D1 fill:#64b5f6
```

## Custom Domain Setup

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph "DNS Configuration"
        DNS[DNS Records]
        CNAME[CNAME: @ → apex-os.pages.dev]
        DNS --> CNAME
    end

    subgraph "Cloudflare"
        Pages[Pages Project]
        Cert[SSL Certificate]
        Domain[Custom Domain<br/>apex-os.com]
    end

    CNAME -->|Points to| Pages
    Pages -->|Provisions| Cert
    Pages -->|Serves| Domain

    subgraph "Traffic Flow"
        User[User] -->|https://apex-os.com| CDN[CDN]
        CDN -->|Routes to| Pages
    end

    Domain -->|Resolves to| User

    style Cert fill:#e91e63
    style Pages fill:#4caf50
```

## Environment Variable Hierarchy

```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph "Priority Order (highest to lowest)"
        P1[1. Cloudflare Pages<br/>Production Env Vars]
        P2[2. Cloudflare Pages<br/>Preview Env Vars]
        P3[3. .env.local<br/>Local development]
        P4[4. .env<br/>Fallback]
        P5[5. Default values<br/>in code]
    end

    P1 -->|Overrides| P2
    P2 -->|Overrides| P3
    P3 -->|Overrides| P4
    P4 -->|Overrides| P5

    note1[Note: Production uses P1 only]
    note2[Note: Set BETTER_AUTH_SECRET in P1]
    note3[Note: Set NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL in P1]

    style P1 fill:#ff6b6b
```

## Database Schema Overview

```mermaid
erDiagram
    profiles ||--o{ affiliate_codes : "has"
    profiles ||--o{ earnings : "receives"
    profiles ||--o{ payouts : "receives"
    profiles ||--o{ deals : "creates"

    affiliate_codes ||--o{ deal_clicks : "generates"
    deal_clicks ||--o{ conversions : "leads to"
    deals ||--o{ deal_clicks : "has"

    profiles }o--|| referral_tree : "parent_of"
    referral_tree }o--|| profiles : "child_of"
    profiles ||--o{ referral_tree : "downline"

    conversions ||--o{ earnings : "creates"
    earnings ||--|| payouts : "batched_in"

    profiles {
        uuid id PK
        string email
        string role
        string wallet_address
        string preferred_chain
        datetime created_at
    }

    affiliate_codes {
        uuid id PK
        uuid user_id FK
        string code UK
        datetime created_at
    }

    referral_tree {
        uuid id PK
        uuid user_id FK
        uuid parent_id FK
        int level
        datetime created_at
    }

    deals {
        uuid id PK
        string exchange
        string title
        decimal cashback_pct
        boolean active
        datetime created_at
    }

    deal_clicks {
        uuid id PK
        uuid deal_id FK
        string affiliate_code
        string ip_hash
        string user_agent_hash
        datetime clicked_at
    }

    conversions {
        uuid id PK
        uuid deal_id FK
        uuid user_id FK
        string wallet_address
        decimal trade_volume_usd
        decimal commission_amount
        datetime converted_at
    }

    earnings {
        uuid id PK
        uuid user_id FK
        uuid source_id FK
        string source_type
        decimal amount
        datetime earned_at
    }

    payouts {
        uuid id PK
        uuid user_id FK
        string stellar_tx_hash
        decimal amount
        string status
        datetime paid_at
    }
```
